      "id": "ClrKernel.Database.Provider.AnalysisServices",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This package split in 0.9. The C# Tabular-model API (DAX queries, metadata, processing) moved to ClrKernel.Database.Provider.AnalysisServices; the #!dax cell language moved to ClrKernel.Language.Dax. The C# entry point was renamed Ssas -> AnalysisServices (e.g. AnalysisServices.Connect(...)); there is no alias, so update notebooks accordingly.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "SQL Server Analysis Services (Tabular) cells for ClrKernel: query models with DAX/DMV, read table & partition metadata, recalculate, process partitions/tables/models, and add or remove partitions — from C# notebook cells via the `Ssas` helper. Works against on-premises SSAS (Windows auth), Azure Analysis Services, and Microsoft Fabric / Power BI semantic models (Entra auth). Built on the Tabular Object Model (AMO) and ADOMD.NET.",
  "iconFile": "logo-64x64.png",
